-This command deploys a test smart contract to the local network. The contract is located in `packages/hardhat/contracts` and can be modified to suit your needs. The `yarn deploy` command uses the deploy script located in `packages/hardhat/deploy` to deploy the contract to the network. You can also customize the deploy script.
+| Variable | Package | Why |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| `NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL` | nextjs | Absolute origin for OG/Twitter images, so link previews unfurl |
+| `NEXT_PUBLIC_BASE_RPC_URL` | nextjs | Dedicated Base RPC; the public fallback is rate-limited |
+| `NEXT_PUBLIC_WALLET_CONNECT_PROJECT_ID` | nextjs | Own WalletConnect project; the scaffold default is shared |
+| `NEXT_PUBLIC_ALCHEMY_API_KEY` | nextjs | Optional secondary RPC transport |
+| `BASE_RPC_URL` | hardhat | Deploys and verification against Base |
+| `ETHERSCAN_API_KEY` | hardhat | Required for contract verification |
 
